    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Any current or future owners of Decent Icons 1 will receive Version 2 for free.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395760/extras/627708fca7beeccf070c6451d1cd3d1d.avif?t=1676961168\" /></div><br><br><br><strong>VERSION 2.0 Early Access Released September 26 - FREE for all owners of Version 1</strong><br>Trailer: <br><br><br><strong>Decent Icons</strong> is a Game Launcher for Windows that gives you complete creative freedom. <br>Create icons for games and software from any screenshot, wallpaper or box art image, no photo editing required! <br><br><strong>Features: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create icons of any size or shape <br></li><li>Use any screenshot, wallpaper, box or fan art image (.JPG or .PNG with Transparency support) <br></li><li>Easily scale and crop your image with Edit Mode<br></li><li>Customizable options include: auto startup (without steam), highlight, titles, overlays, vignette, bevel, reflections, etc <br></li><li>Add a few of your favorite games, or scroll through a larger library with scroll mode<br></li><li>Continuous development and community involvement</li></ul><br>Decent Icons is only available for purchase through Steam, but the software features no DRM or internet connection requirements once it is downloaded.<br>You can run it offline without steam.<br><br>Please share your thoughts and feedback <br>Supports for Windows Vista or Above<br><br><strong>FAQ: Frequently Asked Questions!</strong><br> ",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Any current or future owners of Decent Icons 1 will receive Version 2 for free.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395760/extras/627708fca7beeccf070c6451d1cd3d1d.avif?t=1676961168\" /></div><br><br><br><strong>VERSION 2.0 Early Access Released September 26 - FREE for all owners of Version 1</strong><br>Trailer: <br><br><br><strong>Decent Icons</strong> is a Game Launcher for Windows that gives you complete creative freedom. <br>Create icons for games and software from any screenshot, wallpaper or box art image, no photo editing required! <br><br><strong>Features: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create icons of any size or shape <br></li><li>Use any screenshot, wallpaper, box or fan art image (.JPG or .PNG with Transparency support) <br></li><li>Easily scale and crop your image with Edit Mode<br></li><li>Customizable options include: auto startup (without steam), highlight, titles, overlays, vignette, bevel, reflections, etc <br></li><li>Add a few of your favorite games, or scroll through a larger library with scroll mode<br></li><li>Continuous development and community involvement</li></ul><br>Decent Icons is only available for purchase through Steam, but the software features no DRM or internet connection requirements once it is downloaded.<br>You can run it offline without steam.<br><br>Please share your thoughts and feedback <br>Supports for Windows Vista or Above<br><br><strong>FAQ: Frequently Asked Questions!</strong><br> ",
